{"_meta":{"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://well/widget/97c11919"},"ui/resourceUri":"ui://well/widget/97c11919"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Show accounting settings"},"description":"Draw the accounting-setup card so the USER reviews and confirms the workspace's accounting settings: country of incorporation, incorporation date, tax ID, fiscal year start, base currency, and accounting framework.\n\nThis is the tool for every step that asks the user to complete, review, or CONFIRM the accounting settings \u2014 the close-books settings step, an onboarding \"set up your books\" step. It DRAWS the card, shows each row's provenance and the stored \"Suggested\" fills, lets the user edit what is wrong, and waits for their Confirm. Reach for it directly on such a step; do NOT read the settings first with the silent tool and then decide to draw \u2014 drawing the card IS the step.\n\nThe card gates its Confirm on the required set (fiscal year start and base currency by default; widen it with `required` when a step needs more). ONLY when a step needs the values WITHOUT the user seeing a card (a silent gate check) call `well_get_accounting_settings` instead.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"conversation_id":{"description":"The conversation id returned by the previous Well result, in its meta under well/conversation_id, in its structuredContent, or in its JSON text block. Pass it back on every call in the same conversation, including a call a card makes, so the chosen workspace and the earlier answers still apply. It decides the conversation on its own: nothing the host states about the session replaces it. Omit it only on the first call of a conversation.","type":"string"},"required":{"description":"The card fields the user MUST fill before Confirm is enabled, as an exact list from [\"country\",\"incorporation_date\",\"tax_id\",\"fiscal_year_start_month\",\"base_currency\",\"accounting_framework\"]. Omit to gate on the default set [\"fiscal_year_start_month\",\"base_currency\"]; widen it when a step needs more (never narrow below the default).","items":{"enum":["country","incorporation_date","tax_id","fiscal_year_start_month","base_currency","accounting_framework"],"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"subtitle":{"description":"Supporting line under the card's heading. At most 240 characters. Omit for the default.","maxLength":240,"type":"string"},"title":{"description":"Heading for the accounting-setup card, OVERRIDING the default wording. Use it to frame the step in its flow (e.g. \"Confirm your accounting settings for the close\"). At most 120 characters. Omit for the default wording.","maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"workspace_id":{"description":"Target workspace. Omit when the token authorizes one workspace. Required when it authorizes several: this read reports one workspace's own figures and will not choose which.","format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"workspace_scope":{"description":"Restrict this call to the family: the token's primary workspace plus the company workspaces under it that you are a member of. Unrelated authorized workspaces drop out of the read; row reads merge across the family, while a per-workspace figure still reports exactly one workspace.","enum":["family"],"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"well_show_accounting_settings","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"conversation_id":{"description":"The conversation this result belongs to. Pass it back as the conversation_id argument on every later Well call in the same conversation.","type":"string"},"conversation_id_note":{"description":"Present only when the server opened a fresh lane, stating that no choice recorded earlier was read.","type":"string"},"conversation_id_source":{"description":"Where the conversation id came from: the host's own request meta, the caller's argument, or a fresh lane the server opened.","enum":["host_meta","argument","minted"],"type":"string"},"error":{"type":"string"},"invoice_numbering":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"decision":{"description":"How the first invoice number is set when none is saved. apply_preset: save the preset and say so in one line, with no question. read_last_number: read each number_sources row in order with well_get_last_invoice_number and follow the decisions it returns. ask: a connected tool cannot be read, so offer the preset or a typed number.","enum":["apply_preset","read_last_number","ask"],"type":"string"},"number_sources":{"description":"The invoicing or accounting tools the workspace connected that Well can read the last issued invoice number from, those that serve the company's country first. A tool the workspace did not connect is never listed; empty when none is connected and on a free rule. Read the last number of one with well_get_last_invoice_number.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"connected":{"type":"boolean"},"name":{"type":"string"},"serves_country":{"type":"boolean"},"service_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["service_id","name","connected","serves_country"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"preset_next_invoice_number":{"type":"string"},"rule":{"enum":["continuous_sequence","free"],"type":"string"},"rule_source":{"enum":["country","accounting_framework","fallback"],"type":"string"}},"required":["rule","rule_source","preset_next_invoice_number","decision","number_sources"],"type":"object"},"newly_connected":{"description":"Tools that connected to this workspace since the last result and that no session was told about yet, oldest first. Present only when at least one tool is new. The connected-line rule says when to tell an entry; when it does, one line per entry, in the person's language: \"<name> is connected.\". Never fold several entries into one sentence. Each entry comes back once, on one result only: never repeat its line later.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"service_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name","service_id"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"next_step":{"description":"What to do with the card this result renders. Added by the dispatcher when the card asks for a click.","type":"string"},"required":{"items":{"enum":["country","incorporation_date","tax_id","fiscal_year_start_month","base_currency","accounting_framework"],"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"resolved_workspace":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The workspace that answered, when the caller named none and the token authorizes several.","properties":{"name":{"type":["string","null"]},"workspace_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["workspace_id","name"],"type":"object"},"settings":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"accounting_framework":{"type":["string","null"]},"address":{"type":["string","null"]},"base_currency":{"type":["string","null"]},"business_type":{"type":["string","null"]},"cfe_liable":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"coa_confirmed":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"coa_confirmed_source":{"anyOf":[{"const":"user","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"corporate_tax_regime":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["is","ir"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"country":{"type":["string","null"]},"created_at":{"type":["string","null"]},"default_operation_nature":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["goods","services","mixed"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"domain":{"type":["string","null"]},"field_provenance":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"accounting_framework":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"confidence":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":1,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}]},"healed_at":{"type":"string"},"pri